  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 206.07 Transfer of Location by Presiding Officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 206.07 Transfer of Location by Presiding Officer. A case may be transferred from one designated location to another with due regard for the convenience and necessity of the parties or witnesses, and as the interests of justice may require.\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec200.html"
